 e alla fine dovrà affrontare un giovane giocatore determinato che gli ricorda la sua giovinezza."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Final Set","overview":"Thomas was once renowned as a young tennis prodigy, but never had the career he hoped for. At 37, despite his declining physical fitness and shattered knee he decides to compete in the intense qualifying rounds of the French Open at Roland-Garros for one last attempt at glory. Although his wife Eve and mother Judith advise him to give up, Thomas obsessively pushes forward. He will have to fight his own demons and will ultimately face a determined young player who reminds him of his younger self."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"A presque 38 ans, Thomas est un tennisman qui n’a jamais brillé. Pourtant, il y a 17 ans, il était l’un des plus grands espoirs du tennis. Mais une défaite en demi-finale l’a traumatisé et depuis, il est resté dans les profondeurs du classement. Aujourd’hui, il se prépare à ce qui devrait être son dernier tournoi. Mais il refuse d’abdiquer. Subitement enivré par un désir de sauver son honneur, il se lance dans un combat homérique improbable au résultat incertain..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8azQ1Guc0GJ2lg81uV52oVXAZBg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/paQ75HfeOo8Bt93QeKh7niaiHRl.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":742391,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8azQ1Guc0GJ2lg81uV52oVXAZBg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8azQ1Guc0GJ2lg81uV52oVXAZBg.jpg","language":"it","width":620,"height":870},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8azQ1Guc0GJ2lg81uV52oVXAZBg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8azQ1Guc0GJ2lg81uV52oVXAZBg.jpg","language":"it","width":620,"